        <mxCell id="c66" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined: SurgeDayOvertime (coral), 3,456, 9,216 and 14,112 hours in 2024, 2025 and 2026, and OtherDayOvertime (teal), 6,273, 6,426 and 5,918. Overtime on surge days grew by 10,656 hours while overtime on other days moved by -355: all the growth sits on days that one approver, the Production Manager, approved. The LEFT JOIN to SurgeDays keeps the other days; the editor is scrolled to the final SELECT.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="628" width="860" height="57" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
